['LetB=[[-7/48,(3/32)(1+i√3)],[(5/16)(1−i√3),−9/8]].','The proposed geometric scalar isR=3√3/32;it is independent of the characteristic-polynomial calculation.'],
'Exact characteristic polynomial and instability','trB=−61/48,detB=3/64,andχ_B(t)=t²+(61/48)t+3/64. Its eigenvalues are(−61±√3289)/96,with one strictly below−1.',
'The diagonal product is21/128. The off-diagonal product is(15/512)(1+3)=15/128,so their difference is3/64. The trace is immediate. The discriminant is(61/48)²−4(3/64)=3289/2304,giving the stated roots. Since3289>35²,the negative root(−61−√3289)/96is less than−1. Equivalentlyχ_B(−1)=1−61/48+3/64=−43/192<0whileχ_B(t)→+∞as t→−∞,forcing a root below−1. A nonnegative row-stochastic matrix has induced∞-normoneand spectral radius at mostone;every genuine invariant restriction inherits its eigenvalues. Therefore thisBcannot be such a restriction under a similarity change unless the recovered object differs from that standard operator.',
'Compute the separately proposed logarithmic regulatorR(μ)=∫₀¹log|1−μt|dt.',
'Forμ≠0,substitutionu=1−μtgivesR(μ)=−1−[(1−μ)/μ]log|1−μ|,withR(0)=0by continuity andR(1)=−1. For small positiveμit is negative,approximately−μ/2. Thus a positive geometric scalar cannot automatically equal this integral for arbitrary positiveμ.',
'The concrete block has a complete exact spectral certificate,and a separate regulator formula has a derived normalization.',
'The claimed13×13source matrix and extraction map were not recovered,so the block’s Catmull–Clark provenance is not certified. Algebraic entries alone do not establish a mixed-Tate object or a universal latent dimension.',
